From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandre Derumier <aderumier@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] winedmo: Rewind the DirectShow parser after it delivered
 samples.

dmo_seeking_SetPositions() treats an absolute position equal to
seek.llCurrent as unchanged and only records it, without flushing or
seeking. But seek.llCurrent is the position the streams were last sought
to, not where they are: once a stream thread delivered samples or
EndOfStream, seeking back to that position must seek.

Frenzy Express (Uniana's 2001 arcade scooter game, a Windows PC
based cabinet) loops its music (MP3 through the MPEG-I splitter) with
IMediaSeeking::SetPositions(0) on the filter graph when it gets
EC_COMPLETE. The parser skipped the seek since its position was still 0:
it never delivered anything again, nor EndOfStream (already sent), and
the graph's next state change waited forever for the DirectSound
renderer, hanging the game's window thread.

Treat the position as unchanged only while no active pin delivered a
sample or EndOfStream since the last seek or start.
---
 dlls/winedmo/winedmo_quartz_parser.c | 20 +++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winedmo/winedmo_quartz_parser.c b/dlls/winedmo/winedmo_quartz_parser.c
--- a/dlls/winedmo/winedmo_quartz_parser.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/winedmo_quartz_parser.c
@@ -353,6 +353,23 @@
     return pin->selected && pin->pin.pin.peer;
 }
 
+/* Whether a stream thread delivered a sample or EndOfStream since the last seek or start: the
+ * streams moved away from seek.llCurrent, the position they were sought to. */
+static BOOL dmo_parser_delivered_since_seek(const struct dmo_parser *filter)
+{
+    unsigned int i;
+
+    for (i = 0; i < filter->source_count; ++i)
+    {
+        const struct dmo_parser_source *pin = filter->sources[i];
+
+        if (dmo_parser_source_is_active(pin) && (!pin->need_segment || pin->eos_sent))
+            return TRUE;
+    }
+
+    return FALSE;
+}
+
 static BOOL dmo_parser_has_selected_stream_type(const struct dmo_parser *filter, const GUID *major_type)
 {
     unsigned int i;
@@ -619,7 +636,8 @@
     }
 
     current_unchanged = !current || current_positioning == AM_SEEKING_NoPositioning
-            || (current_positioning == AM_SEEKING_AbsolutePositioning && *current == pin->seek.llCurrent)
+            || (current_positioning == AM_SEEKING_AbsolutePositioning && *current == pin->seek.llCurrent
+                && !dmo_parser_delivered_since_seek(filter))
             || (current_positioning == AM_SEEKING_RelativePositioning && !*current)
             || (current_positioning == AM_SEEKING_IncrementalPositioning && !*current);
     if (current_unchanged)
